+=====================================================================+
| DEMONSTRATION 1: INCONSISTENT LOCK ORDERING (CIRCULAR WAIT DEADLOCK)|
+=====================================================================+
Process A Strategy : Lock1 -> Lock2 (Rank 1 then Rank 2)
Process B Strategy : Lock2 -> Lock1 (Rank 2 then Rank 1 - VIOLATION!)

[Process A] Attempting to acquire Lock1 (Printer) [Rank 1]...
  [+] GRANTED: Lock1 (Printer) successfully locked by Process A
[Process B] Attempting to acquire Lock2 (Scanner) [Rank 2]...
  [+] GRANTED: Lock2 (Scanner) successfully locked by Process B

--- Interleaved execution pause (both hold 1 resource) ---

[Process A] Attempting to acquire Lock2 (Scanner) [Rank 2]...
  [-] BLOCKED: Lock2 (Scanner) is currently HELD by Process P2 -> WAITING
[Process B] Attempting to acquire Lock1 (Printer) [Rank 1]...
  [-] BLOCKED: Lock1 (Printer) is currently HELD by Process P1 -> WAITING

[!] DIAGNOSIS: DEADLOCK CONFIRMED!
    Process A holds Lock1 and blocks waiting for Lock2.
    Process B holds Lock2 and blocks waiting for Lock1.
    Circular dependency: Process A <---> Process B

+=====================================================================+
| DEMONSTRATION 2: STRICT HIERARCHICAL ORDERING (DEADLOCK PREVENTED) |
+=====================================================================+
Enforced Hierarchy Rule: Lock1 (Rank 1) < Lock2 (Rank 2)
All processes must strictly acquire in ascending rank order.

[Process A] Attempting to acquire Lock1 (Printer) [Rank 1]...
  [+] GRANTED: Lock1 (Printer) successfully locked by Process A
[Process B] Attempting to acquire Lock1 (Printer) [Rank 1]...
  [-] BLOCKED: Lock1 (Printer) is currently HELD by Process P1 -> WAITING
[Process A] Attempting to acquire Lock2 (Scanner) [Rank 2]...
  [+] GRANTED: Lock2 (Scanner) successfully locked by Process A
[Process A] Both locks secured. Executing critical section workload...
[Process A] RELEASED Lock2 (Scanner)
[Process A] RELEASED Lock1 (Printer)

--- Process A finished and released all locks; Process B wakes up ---

[Process B] Attempting to acquire Lock1 (Printer) [Rank 1]...
  [+] GRANTED: Lock1 (Printer) successfully locked by Process B
[Process B] Attempting to acquire Lock2 (Scanner) [Rank 2]...
  [+] GRANTED: Lock2 (Scanner) successfully locked by Process B
[Process B] Both locks secured. Executing critical section workload...
[Process B] RELEASED Lock2 (Scanner)
[Process B] RELEASED Lock1 (Printer)

[+] DIAGNOSIS: EXECUTION COMPLETED SUCCESSFULLY!
    Strict total ordering eliminated Circular Wait.
    All processes completed without blocking or hanging.

